  "description": "Vintage Christmas Digital Paper Collection features 19 seamless digital paper designs inspired by nostalgic Christmas memories, classic holiday illustrations, vintage ornaments, snowmen, Victorian-style children, festive greenery, snowflakes, Christmas typography, and traditional winter music.\nThe collection combines rich burgundy red, deep forest green, muted teal, warm cream, antique beige, and classic Christmas tones with distressed vintage textures and softly aged paper effects. Designs include charming vintage snowmen, nostalgic children in traditional winter clothing, ornate Christmas ornaments, golden snowflakes, evergreen branches, pinecones, holly berries, vintage sheet music, distressed Christmas typography, and softly weathered holiday backgrounds.\nPerfect for Christmas scrapbooking, holiday stationery, greeting cards, gift tags, wrapping paper, invitations, printable crafts, sublimation, apparel, fabric and textile design, gift packaging, junk journals, Christmas planners, party decorations, and other festive creative projects.\nFeatures:\n– 19 unique seamless digital paper patterns\n– High-resolution JPG files\n– 300 DPI\n– Vintage Christmas aesthetic\n– Nostalgic retro holiday illustrations\n– Classic red, green, teal, cream, and burgundy palette\n– Vintage snowmen and Christmas character designs\n– Traditional Christmas ornaments and snowflakes\n– Evergreen, pinecone and holly details\n– Vintage sheet music elements\n– Distressed and aged paper textures\n– Antique-inspired typography and backgrounds\n– Seamless repeating patterns\n– Suitable for digital and print projects",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Vintage Christmas Digital Paper Collection features 19 seamless digital paper designs inspired by nostalgic Christmas memories, classic holiday illustrations, vintage ornaments, snowmen, Victorian-style children, festive greenery, snowflakes, Christmas typography, and traditional winter music.</p>\n<p>The collection combines rich burgundy red, deep forest green, muted teal, warm cream, antique beige, and classic Christmas tones with distressed vintage textures and softly aged paper effects. Designs include charming vintage snowmen, nostalgic children in traditional winter clothing, ornate Christmas ornaments, golden snowflakes, evergreen branches, pinecones, holly berries, vintage sheet music, distressed Christmas typography, and softly weathered holiday backgrounds.</p>\n<p>Perfect for Christmas scrapbooking, holiday stationery, greeting cards, gift tags, wrapping paper, invitations, printable crafts, sublimation, apparel, fabric and textile design, gift packaging, junk journals, Christmas planners, party decorations, and other festive creative projects.</p>\n<p>Features:<br>\n– 19 unique seamless digital paper patterns<br>\n– High-resolution JPG files<br>\n– 300 DPI<br>\n– Vintage Christmas aesthetic<br>\n– Nostalgic retro holiday illustrations<br>\n– Classic red, green, teal, cream, and burgundy palette<br>\n– Vintage snowmen and Christmas character designs<br>\n– Traditional Christmas ornaments and snowflakes<br>\n– Evergreen, pinecone and holly details<br>\n– Vintage sheet music elements<br>\n– Distressed and aged paper textures<br>\n– Antique-inspired typography and backgrounds<br>\n– Seamless repeating patterns<br>\n– Suitable for digital and print projects</p>",
